    "description": "Manual Check process (expanded from C.9.2). Adds a parallel split for concurrent fraud and risk checks, an escalation gateway routing detected fraud to a Senior Reviewer, and an intermediate message catch event awaiting additional documents. Three event sub-processes handle document, accelerated, and fraud flows."
